  "worked_solution": "Let's examine the solids one-by-one.\n\n- I  is a polyhedron and it has exactly $6$ faces.\n\n- II  is a polyhedron and it has exactly $5$ faces.\n\n- III is a polyhedron but it has exactly $4$ faces.\n\nTherefore, the answer is \"III only\".",
